C("A MAC-like inventory address is six pairs of uppercase hexadecimal digits separated by colons, followed by /L2. Only format is checked.",r"(?:[0-9A-F]{2}:){5}[0-9A-F]{2}\/L2","00:00:00:00:00:00/L2|FF:FF:FF:FF:FF:FF/L2|01:23:45:67:89:AB/L2|AB:CD:EF:01:23:45/L2|10:20:30:40:50:60/L2|AA:BB:CC:DD:EE:FF/L2|12:34:56:78:90:AB/L2|F0:0F:A0:0A:B0:0B/L2","00:00:00:00:00/L2|00:00:00:00:00:00:00/L2|aa:BB:CC:DD:EE:FF/L2|GG:00:00:00:00:00/L2|00-00-00-00-00-00/L2|0:00:00:00:00:00/L2", "Pair width and repeated separator count both matter.")
