C("A local endpoint is exactly tcp://node.test: followed by a port from 9000 through 9099. No path or spaces.",r"tcp:\/\/node\.test:90[0-9]{2}","tcp://node.test:9000|tcp://node.test:9001|tcp://node.test:9009|tcp://node.test:9010|tcp://node.test:9050|tcp://node.test:9097|tcp://node.test:9098|tcp://node.test:9099","tcp://node.test:8999|tcp://node.test:9100|tcp://node.test:900|tcp://node.test:90000|udp://node.test:9000|tcp://nodeXtest:9000", "A fixed port band is stricter than generic valid ports.")
