C("An IPv6 hextet display is exactly eight uppercase hexadecimal groups, each four characters, separated by colons, prefixed with ip6:. Compression and lowercase are forbidden; format only.",r"ip6:(?:[0-9A-F]{4}:){7}[0-9A-F]{4}","ip6:0000:0000:0000:0000:0000:0000:0000:0000|ip6:FFFF:FFFF:FFFF:FFFF:FFFF:FFFF:FFFF:FFFF|ip6:0001:0002:0003:0004:0005:0006:0007:0008|ip6:ABCD:1234:5678:90AB:CDEF:0000:0001:0002|ip6:AAAA:BBBB:CCCC:DDDD:EEEE:FFFF:0000:1111|ip6:1000:2000:3000:4000:5000:6000:7000:8000|ip6:0000:0000:0000:0000:0000:0000:0000:0001|ip6:FE80:0000:0000:0000:0000:0000:0000:0001","ip6:0:0000:0000:0000:0000:0000:0000:0000|ip6:0000:0000:0000:0000:0000:0000:0000|ip6:0000:0000:0000:0000:0000:0000:0000:0000:0000|ip6:fe80:0000:0000:0000:0000:0000:0000:0001|ip6:GGGG:0000:0000:0000:0000:0000:0000:0000|ip6:::1", "Fixed expanded groups deliberately exclude otherwise valid IPv6 forms.")
