C("A unicast lab address is exactly 192.168.4. followed by a canonical decimal host 1 through 254 and slash prefix length 24 through 30. No leading zeros in either variable field.",r"192\.168\.4\.(?:[1-9]|[1-9][0-9]|1[0-9]{2}|2[0-4][0-9]|25[0-4])\/(?:2[4-9]|30)","192.168.4.1/24|192.168.4.254/30|192.168.4.9/25|192.168.4.10/26|192.168.4.99/27|192.168.4.100/28|192.168.4.249/29|192.168.4.250/30","192.168.4.0/24|192.168.4.255/24|192.168.4.01/24|192.168.4.1/23|192.168.4.1/31|192.168.5.1/24|192X168.4.1/24", "Host and prefix ranges are independent and dots are literal.")
